# Machine-specific settings, sourced by scripts/env.sh and the makefile.
# Copy to .env and edit. Experiment settings (model, budgets, method) belong in
# config/*.conf, not here.

# Virtual environment activated by every launcher in scripts/ (optional).
# VENV_PATH=/path/to/.venv

# Hugging Face caches. Meta-Llama checkpoints are gated: run `huggingface-cli login`.
# HF_HOME=/path/to/hf_cache
# HF_HUB_CACHE=$HF_HOME/hub
# HF_DATASETS_CACHE=$HF_HOME

# Locally generated RULER 64K/128K configs (experiments/RULER/long_context/make_data.sh).
# RULER_LOCAL_DIR=/path/to/ruler_long

# Large temporary files (prefill caches, CUDA kernel build).
# TMPDIR=/path/to/tmp
# TORCH_EXTENSIONS_DIR=/path/to/torch_extensions

# Clusters with environment modules: the CUDA kernel in csrc/ needs the same GCC and
# CUDA at run time as at build time (e.g. GCC 11.3 + CUDA 12.1 for torch 2.1.2).
# module load GCC/11.3.0 CUDA/12.1.1
